 eck\, we created a detailed\, 3-dimensional model which Champlain College 
 students transformed into this virtual reality dive. Stop by Fragments: Vo
 ices of the American Revolution on Lake Champlain and experience it for yo
 urself! Accessibility: From the flexi-pave path\, there is one wheelchair 
 accessible entrance to Fragments on the north side of the building. The ex
 hibit space is fully ADA compliant. Every week through Oct 15\, 2026.\n\nS
 ources: Vermont Public
